{"n": 605, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "605.webp", "text": "32-55.1\n\nTROUBLESHOOTING B - Control Lamp Fiashes (Siemens Diagnosis Unit)\n\nThe “airbag system\" employs a fault detector and memory, even for briefly occurring faults. If the\n“airbag control lamp” flashes after starting (about 5 minutes) and remains on afterwards, there could\nbe one or more faults. The flashing code via the control lamp or BMW DIAGNOSING SYSTEM will\nhelp only personne! with qualified training In BMW service to pinpoint and eliminate the faults.\n\nThe flashing code can be called by performing the following procedures and as often as desired.\n\nA) Turn off ignition.\n\nB) Connect airbag diagnosis plug 62 1 290 to operating Instructions.\n\nC) Turn ignition lock key to position 1.\n\nFlashing code will now run off and the number of flashes must be counted.\n6s Bulb test\n\nFlashes 1 to times depending on the number of faults\n3s Dark\n\n3s Start for fault code\n3s Dark\n\nFlashes 1 to 4 times - note number - for example\n\n3s Dark\n\nFlashes 1 to 4 times - note number - for example - 2-3-3 - see fault code\n\nif\nIn case of more than table\n\none fault this section\nis repeated as often\nas the number of\nfaults.\n\n3s Dark\nFlashes 1 to 4 times - note number - for example\n\n3s Dark\n1 time = brief fault (e.g. brief break of plug contact)\nFlashes 1 or 2 times\n2 times = permanent fault\n\n3s Dark\n\n3s Break/start with more than 1 fault repeat\nLamp on continuously = end of check control", "words": [["32-55.1", 0.4732, 0.0332, 0.5593, 0.057], ["TROUBLESHOOTING", 0.2736, 0.0729, 0.388, 0.0849], ["B", 0.3886, 0.0703, 0.3941, 0.0922], ["-", 0.4032, 0.0796, 0.4093, 0.0822], ["Control", 0.4129, 0.0743, 0.4519, 0.0855], ["Lamp", 0.4569, 0.0743, 0.4858, 0.0889], ["Fiashes", 0.4899, 0.0743, 0.5309, 0.0862], ["(Siemens", 0.535, 0.0743, 0.5851, 0.0889], ["Diagnosis", 0.5892, 0.0743, 0.6424, 0.0889], ["Unit)", 0.6464, 0.0743, 0.6717, 0.0889], ["The", 0.2736, 0.1061, 0.2933, 0.118], ["“airbag"